Package: yara-x
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: malware identification and classification tool
 YARA-X is the Rust-based rewrite of the well-known YARA tool aimed at
 helping malware researchers identify and classify malware samples.
 With YARA-X you can create descriptions of malware families based on
 textual or binary patterns contained in samples. Each description
 consists of a set of strings and a Boolean expression which determines
 its logic.

Package: yara-x-bash-completion
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, yara-x, bash-completion
Enhances: yara-x
Description: Bash completion support for yara-x
 This package provides command-line tab completion support for the
 yara-x (yr) pattern-matching tool in Bash shells. It enables quick
 auto-completion for all CLI subcommands (scan, compile, dump, fmt,
 check) and their respective options.
